505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 460 0 R
/E ( CRICKSTATS is a modern, data-driven Cricket Performance Analytics Platform built on the Salesforce Lightning Platform. This application completely replaces manual scorecard tracking methods by systematically storing, calculating, and analyzing players' match-by-match metrics. Built on standard and custom Salesforce architecture \(Custom Objects, Master-Detail Relationships, Automated Flows, and Dynamic Dashboards\), it serves as a comprehensive system to track individual player growth curves. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
